{"book":"psalms","lang":"en2","model":"glm-5.3","timestamp":"2026-08-29T23:23:14.837395704Z","verse":20,"ref":"psalms 147:20","tier":"glm-5.2","chapter":147,"translation":"He has not done so for any nation; and as for His ordinances, they have not known them. Hallelu Yah!","tokens":[{"surface":"לא","gloss":"not"},{"surface":"עשה","gloss":"He has done"},{"surface":"כן","gloss":"so"},{"surface":"לכל","gloss":"for any"},{"surface":"גוי","gloss":"nation"},{"surface":"ומשפטים","gloss":"and as for ordinances"},{"surface":"בל","gloss":"not at all"},{"surface":"ידעום","gloss":"they have known them"},{"surface":"הללו","gloss":"Hallelu"},{"surface":"יה","gloss":"Yah"}]}